+# Mini Task Manager
+
+A minimal FastAPI and SQLite task manager application implementing core persistence and REST endpoints.
+
+## API Endpoints
+- `POST /tasks`: Create a task with a non-blank title. Returns `201 Created` with `id`, `title`, and `status`.
+- `GET /tasks`: Retrieve all stored tasks in stable ID order.
+
+## Requirements
+- FastAPI 0.162.0
+- Pytest 9.2.0
+- Httpx 0.28.1
+- Uvicorn 0.54.0
+
+## Running Tests
+```bash
+PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/pytest -v
+```
